<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>痈疽并无名疮毒 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%97%88%E7%96%BD%E5%B9%B6%E6%97%A0%E5%90%8D%E7%96%AE%E6%AF%92/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mtcmp1fx</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 14:55:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%97%88%E7%96%BD%E5%B9%B6%E6%97%A0%E5%90%8D%E7%96%AE%E6%AF%92/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>痈疽并无名疮毒</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-22-yongdoubingwumingchuangdu/</link><pubDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 14:51:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-22-yongdoubingwumingchuangdu/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%85%AD%E6%95%B0%E9%9B%86/">卷六数集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“痈疽并无名疮毒”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;传出一首通治一切痈疽、无名肿毒的神效方，并作为全篇传道之结语。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;痈疽发背、疮毒肿疡，无论已溃未溃、阳毒阴毒，皆可以此方内消或收敛。其要在重用金银花、当归等药，量大而专，攻散诸毒而不损真气，可多服久服无碍&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>